{"ID":"20240206091538-jm0t3w3","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240206091538-jm0t3w3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091538-jm0t3w3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240411115930-ig4zfnq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611161909-wcp2g97\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240625095120-ryqrl27\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:7,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:7\u0026#125;","title":"184紫参（拳参）","type":"doc","updated":"20240820090522"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240411115930-ig4zfnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411115930-ig4zfnq","updated":"20240411115932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】紫参、草河车、刀剪药、铜罗、虾参、地虾、山虾、疙瘩参、牡蒙、众戎、倒根草、童肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240411115945-k92sxe1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411115945-k92sxe1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产西北、华北地区及山东、江苏等地。\n【性状】\t根茎扁圆柱形，弯曲成虾状，长415cm，直径l2.5cm。表面紫褐色或紫黑色，稍粗糙，全体密被粗环纹，具残留须根或根痕，一面隆起，另面较平坦或略具凹槽。质硬，断面近肾形，浅棕红色，黄白色维管束细点排成断续环状。气微，味苦、涩。\n【性味】\t苦、涩，微寒。\n【功效】\t清热镇惊，理湿消肿。治热病惊搐，破伤风，赤痢，痈肿，瘰疬。清热利湿；凉血止血；解毒散结。主肺热咳嗽；热病惊痫；赤痢；热泻；吐血；衄血；痔疮出血；痈肿疮毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240206091544-dg8pug7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091544-dg8pug7","updated":"20240206091544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206091544-4r14ipl.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240625094928-9dj8awd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625094928-9dj8awd","updated":"20240625094928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 607px;","style":"width: 597px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"紫参1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/紫参1-20240625094928-af6ftqv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 597px;\" parent-style=\"width: 607px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240625095014-h39iley","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625095014-h39iley","updated":"20240815165319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 389px;","style":"width: 379px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"紫参2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/紫参2-20240625095013-o9wqych.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 379px;\" parent-style=\"width: 389px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 364px;","style":"width: 354px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"紫参3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/紫参3-20240625095203-2ss5xl6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 354px;\" parent-style=\"width: 364px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240625100251-xxpiz6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625100251-xxpiz6q","updated":"20240815172031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 421px;","style":"width: 411px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"拳参8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/拳参8-20240625100252-7z7o53x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 411px;\" parent-style=\"width: 421px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 552px;","style":"width: 542px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"紫参 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/紫参 9-20240815171720-8hnteh7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 542px;\" parent-style=\"width: 552px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240815165650-m2uyyyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240815165650-m2uyyyu","updated":"20240819133933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 411px;","style":"width: 401px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"拳参6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/拳参6-20240625095837-2r01jh6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 401px;\" parent-style=\"width: 411px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 409px;","style":"width: 399px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"紫参 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/紫参 8-20240815170830-lw6eti7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 399px;\" parent-style=\"width: 409px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240815165609-ab1nc1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240815165609-ab1nc1o","updated":"20240815165751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 549px;","style":"width: 539px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"紫参"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/紫参-20240815165609-22whrth.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 539px;\" parent-style=\"width: 549px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 618px;","style":"width: 608px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"紫参 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/紫参 2-20240815165751-hy64ssr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 608px;\" parent-style=\"width: 618px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718140048-iauh1qx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718140048-iauh1qx","updated":"20240815171950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 287px;","style":"width: 277px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"紫参 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/紫参 10-20240815171950-lv0g4nd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 277px;\" parent-style=\"width: 287px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 665px;","style":"width: 655px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"紫参 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/紫参 6-20240815170617-3sd66b4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 655px;\" parent-style=\"width: 665px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 324px;","style":"width: 314px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"紫参 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/紫参 5-20240815170538-xa6s85j.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 314px;\" parent-style=\"width: 324px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240815170444-s6wfzs1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240815170444-s6wfzs1","updated":"20240815170850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 434px;","style":"width: 424px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"酸浆 (17)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/酸浆 17-20240815165408-lfee1pn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 424px;\" parent-style=\"width: 434px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 522px;","style":"width: 512px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"紫参 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/紫参 3-20240815165848-047e3nc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 512px;\" parent-style=\"width: 522px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 283px;","style":"width: 273px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"紫参 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/紫参 4-20240815170445-yu1qkzt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 273px;\" parent-style=\"width: 283px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240815170212-cc0nvnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240815170212-cc0nvnn","updated":"20240815172338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：取图为拳参；（紫参存疑，网上有说法真正的紫参根部并不是紫的，据说真紫参丢到火里烧会变紫）"}]},{"ID":"20240815172535-kwq8kw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240815172535-kwq8kw6","updated":"20240820090522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：也有说紫参为珍珠菜的根；"}]},{"ID":"20240611161839-6u4yp6q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161839-6u4yp6q"}},{"ID":"20240611162051-3pagle8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162051-3pagle8","updated":"20240611162056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162051-ngf7jin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162051-ngf7jin","updated":"20240611162051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦辛寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162051-g5ftsuc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162051-g5ftsuc","updated":"20240611162051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主心腹积聚，寒热邪气。通九窍，利大小便。一名牡蒙。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162051-9uso3vr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162051-9uso3vr","updated":"20240611162051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：伏蒙，一名紫参，一名泉戎，一名音腹，一名伏菟，一名重伤。神农黄帝苦，李氏小寒，生河西山谷或宛句商山，圆聚生，根黄赤有文，皮黑中紫，五月花紫，赤实黑，大如豆，三月采根。（《御览》《大观本》节文）"}]},{"ID":"20240611162051-0wx2t7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162051-0wx2t7u","updated":"20240611162051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名众戎，一名童肠：一名马行，生河西及冤句，三月采根，火炙使紫色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162051-q29j713","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162051-q29j713","updated":"20240611162051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《范子计然》云：紫参出三辅，赤青色者善。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162116-30yglp7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611162116-30yglp7"}},{"ID":"20240611162117-uhsdlio","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162117-uhsdlio","updated":"20240611162122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162117-zdccgdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162117-zdccgdh","updated":"20240611162117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦辛，寒，微寒，无毒。主心腹积聚，寒热邪气，通九窍，利大小便，疗肠胃唾血，衄血，肠中聚血，痈肿诸疮，止渴益精。一名牡蒙，一名众戎，一名童肠，一名马行。生河西及冤句山谷，三月采根，火炙使紫色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162128-1xjndou","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611162128-1xjndou"}},{"ID":"20240611162129-bggsdox","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162129-bggsdox","updated":"20240611162136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162129-li1acl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162129-li1acl5","updated":"20240611162132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"紫参"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生河西及冤句山谷，今河中解、晋、齐及淮、蜀州郡皆有之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162129-426jqxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162129-426jqxb","updated":"20240611162129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苗长一、二尺；根淡紫色如地黄状；茎青而细，叶亦青，似槐叶，亦有似羊蹄者；五月开花，白色似葱花，亦有红紫而似水荭者；根皮紫黑，肉红白色，肉浅而皮深。三月采根，火炙令紫色。又云∶六月采，晒干用。张仲景治痢紫参汤主之。紫参半斤，甘草二两，以水五升，煎紫参，取二升，内甘草，煎取半升，分温三服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162301-rdoyuxu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611162301-rdoyuxu"}},{"ID":"20240611162302-sn6tvzq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162302-sn6tvzq","updated":"20240611162308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162302-og8fzlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162302-og8fzlm","updated":"20240611162302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦辛寒。主心腹积聚。寒热邪气。通九窍。利大小便。一名牡蒙。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162302-zwctl0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162302-zwctl0r","updated":"20240611162302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三辅幽芳。青赤弥谷。飞羽翩翻。歧蹄排蹴。浓积阴沉。坚消心腹。火炙根温。紫光熠煜。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162302-inw2w0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162302-inw2w0o","updated":"20240611162302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"范计然曰。紫参出三辅。以青赤色为善。钱起序。紫参幽芳也。五葩连萼。状飞禽羽举。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162302-uoohl8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162302-uoohl8h","updated":"20240611162302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"张衡赋。众鸟翩翻。苏恭曰。叶似羊蹄。何逊七召。亦左排而右蹴。李时珍曰。气味俱浓。阴也沉也。甄权曰。治心腹坚胀。苏颂曰。三月采根。火炙紫色。柳宗元。晋问日晶熠煜。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162251-5hpiy4q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611162251-5hpiy4q"}},{"ID":"20240611162252-u7nj2az","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162252-u7nj2az","updated":"20240611162256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162252-s1n7rxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162252-s1n7rxr","updated":"20240611162252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气微寒，味苦、辛。无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162252-2aqfnyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162252-2aqfnyg","updated":"20240611162252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶主心腹积聚，寒热邪气，通九窍，利大小便。疗肠胃大热，唾血衄血，肠中聚血，痈肿诸疮，止渴益精。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162252-l282aaq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162252-l282aaq","updated":"20240611162252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仲景治痢，紫参汤主之。紫参半斤，甘草三两，水五升，煎紫参取二升。却内甘草，煎取半升，分温三服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162236-ydvbize","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611162236-ydvbize"}},{"ID":"20240611162238-et7vhcz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162238-et7vhcz","updated":"20240611162244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162238-igz6eg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162238-igz6eg6","updated":"20240611162238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名牡蒙"}]},{"ID":"20240611162238-mrwbl64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162238-mrwbl64","updated":"20240611162238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"畏辛夷。苦，寒。入足厥阴经血分。破结逐瘀。通九窍，利二便，退寒热，除疟痢。（疟有蓄血则狂，肠胃湿热，致血瘀而成血痢。）配阿胶、乌梅，治吐血。配甘草、龙芽草，治血痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162222-0l4xmfd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611162222-0l4xmfd"}},{"ID":"20240611162223-xocz3yj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162223-xocz3yj","updated":"20240611162227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162223-h1qosn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162223-h1qosn8","updated":"20240611162223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"色紫入肝．气寒散血．行瘀破积．皆因微苦微辛．治痢通经．却又能通能降．（紫参苦寒之性．略兼辛味．全无补益．只能入肝行血清血．凡血崩血痢．以及痈肿诸疮．胸腹积聚而有瘀热者．皆可用之．一名牡蒙．五月结实．六月采根．色紫形似丹参．用亦相近．但丹参性平有甘味．此则寒兼苦辛无甘味耳．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611162209-s08czeb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611162209-s08czeb"}},{"ID":"20240611162210-lihdpag","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162210-lihdpag","updated":"20240611162217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162210-deele4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162210-deele4i","updated":"20240611162210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经中品）"}]},{"ID":"20240611162210-5empga3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162210-5empga3","updated":"20240611162210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】苦寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162210-5uyp6oc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162210-5uyp6oc","updated":"20240611162210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主治心腹积聚，寒热邪气，通九窍，利大小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162210-sd5rewn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162210-sd5rewn","updated":"20240611162210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶紫参，生河西、冤句山谷，今河中、淮郡、三辅皆有之。茎高一二尺，叶似槐；亦有状羊蹄者，色青绿。五月开花，白色似葱。花，亦有红紫水荭色者。实黑，大如豆，圆"}]},{"ID":"20240611162210-naitqi2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162210-naitqi2","updated":"20240611162210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【参】曰∶赤黑兼色而得紫，参水火相射者，既济之为参也。犹未离乎火味之苦，水寒之气，金亦互，木亦交矣。故腑脏咸入，根身并叶尔。脏在胸，腑在腹；积者，五脏之所生；"}]},{"ID":"20240611162210-ror22py","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162210-ror22py","updated":"20240611162210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"聚者，六腑之所成也。积解聚散而寒热平，清阳仍走上窍而利，浊阴仍走下窍而通矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162155-awd721z","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611162155-awd721z"}},{"ID":"20240611162156-88nfnrs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162156-88nfnrs","updated":"20240611162203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162156-r2kgjd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162156-r2kgjd2","updated":"20240611162156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即牡蒙，又名童肠，三四月间遍地茸生，高三五寸，逐层起台，开紫花者是也"}]},{"ID":"20240611162156-y6wnxcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162156-y6wnxcb","updated":"20240611162156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦辛寒，无毒。反藜芦。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162156-nhn3yjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162156-nhn3yjx","updated":"20240611162156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主心腹积聚，寒热邪气，通九窍，利大小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162156-wdwwcr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162156-wdwwcr3","updated":"20240611162156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参入足厥阴兼入足太阳、阳明血分，故治诸血病，及寒热血痢，痈肿积块。即《本经》治心腹积聚，寒热邪气之谓。瘀血去，则九窍利，而二便通矣。古方治妇人肠覃，乌喙丸中用牡蒙即紫参也。仲景治下痢、肺痛，用紫参汤，取其散积血也。但市人罕识其真，详痢下肺痛皆胸中气结之故，每以紫菀代之，虽气味之寒温不同，疏利之性则一。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162141-ilgqwo3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611162141-ilgqwo3"}},{"ID":"20240611162142-z1v9999","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162142-z1v9999","updated":"20240611162147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162142-75wamh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162142-75wamh1","updated":"20240611162142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦寒，无毒。主治心腹积聚，寒热邪气，通九窍、大小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162142-ppkfim9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162142-ppkfim9","updated":"20240611162142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（紫参《本经》名牡蒙，出河西及冤句山谷，今河中晋解齐及淮蜀州郡皆有之。苗长一二尺，茎青而细，叶似槐叶，亦有似羊蹄者。五月开细白花，似葱花，亦有红紫，而似水荭者。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162142-d30usmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162142-d30usmi","updated":"20240611162142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根淡紫黑色，如地黄状，肉红白色，内浅皮深，三月采根，火炙干便成紫色。又云六月采，晒干用。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611162142-e14hjvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162142-e14hjvv","updated":"20240611162142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》泽漆汤方，用紫参。本论云∶咳而脉沉者，泽漆汤主之。《纲目集解》云∶古方所用牡蒙，皆为紫参，而陶氏又以王孙为牡蒙，今用亦希。因《金匮》方有紫参，故存于此。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162104-3mvo8uc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611162104-3mvo8uc"}},{"ID":"20240611162106-284pen6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162106-284pen6","updated":"20240611162110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162106-yknlxr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162106-yknlxr3","updated":"20240611162106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、辛，寒、微寒，无毒。主治心腹积聚，寒热邪气，通九窍，利大小便。治肠胃大热，唾血，衄血，肠中聚血，痈肿诸疮，止渴，益精。一名牡蒙，一名众戎，一名童肠，一名马行。生河西及宛朐山谷，三月采根，火炙使紫色。（畏辛夷。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611162106-70kictn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162106-70kictn","updated":"20240611162106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今方家皆呼为牡蒙，用之亦少。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161839-2dc2eao","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161839-2dc2eao"}},{"ID":"20240611162041-bt8vnts","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162041-bt8vnts","updated":"20240611162046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162041-xj8irlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162041-xj8irlp","updated":"20240611162041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"微寒，无毒．主治肠胃大热，唾血，衄血，肠中聚血，痈肿诸疮，止渴，益精．一戎，一名童肠，一名马行．生河西及宛朐．三月采根，火炙使紫色．（畏辛夷．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611162041-vi0eiq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162041-vi0eiq9","updated":"20240611162041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶紫参，味苦、辛，寒．主心腹积聚，寒热邪气，通九窍，利大小便．一名牡蒙．生山谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240611162008-wfxo3f1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611162008-wfxo3f1"}},{"ID":"20240611162030-0vidvz1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162030-0vidvz1","updated":"20240611162036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162030-iib60wm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162030-iib60wm","updated":"20240611162030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名牡蒙。六月采根。晒干。皮色红紫。肉带红白。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162030-6j1v9ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162030-6j1v9ay","updated":"20240611162030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦辛微寒。气味俱浓。阴也。降也。入足厥阴。亦入足阳明。为除热散结逐血之要药。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162030-u5v4sxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162030-u5v4sxf","updated":"20240611162030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主心腹积聚。寒热邪气。（皆因于血之滞）通九窍。利大小便。治肠胃大热。血痢吐衄。肠中聚血。妇人血闭。治诸血病。及痈肿积块之属厥阴者。疗金疮。破血生肌肉。止渴。补虚益气。佐甘草。治下利纯血腹痛。名紫参汤。吐血不止。用紫参阿胶甘草等分。为末。乌梅汤或糯米汤服一二钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162030-g79slv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162030-g79slv1","updated":"20240611162030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕紫参专入血分。而血分之治。专主其滞者。何也。以此品五月开花。虽苦寒而实透于至阳之气化以出。即采根亦以六月阳极之候。非因其乘阳气以化阴者。入血而奏宣瘀和血之功乎。若止用其苦寒以对待血滞。虽有大热。恐不免犯寒泣之忌矣。况补虚益气。如苏恭所说。岂能责之苦寒乎。由斯绎之。则兹味不甚寒而能疗大热之溢血。亦善物也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162008-tpw5kqg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611162008-tpw5kqg"}},{"ID":"20240611162020-ph0o9ik","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162020-ph0o9ik","updated":"20240611162025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162020-50o4p13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162020-50o4p13","updated":"20240611162020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（山草）泻肝血瘀"}]},{"ID":"20240611162020-gwl8l4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162020-gwl8l4x","updated":"20240611162020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参（专入肝。兼入胃膀胱。又名牡蒙）。味苦而辛。气寒无毒。功专入肝逐瘀破血。兼入胃腑膀胱。使血自为通利。故凡寒热血痢。痈肿积块。心腹积聚。因于血瘀阻滞而成者。无不可以调治。以其味苦则泄。味辛入肝。寒则胜热。而使血从二便出矣！仲景治下痢腹痛。而用紫参汤以除。亦取散其积血之意。（圣惠方治吐血不止。用紫参人参阿胶炒。等分为末。乌梅汤服一钱。一方。去人参。加甘草。以糯米汤服。普济用五参丸。治面上酒刺。用紫参丹参人参苦参沙参各一两。为末。胡桃仁杵和为丸。茶下。）但市人罕识其真。用以紫菀为代。虽其寒热不同。而其疏利则一。反藜芦。（古方治妇人肠覃病乌啄丸。所用牡蒙。即此物也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611162008-h6i6ngd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611162008-h6i6ngd"}},{"ID":"20240611162011-vls43nm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611162011-vls43nm","updated":"20240611162015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611162011-b9bzcqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162011-b9bzcqc","updated":"20240611162011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、辛，寒、微寒，无毒。主心腹积聚，寒热邪气，通九窍，利大小便。疗肠胃大热，唾痈肿诸疮，止渴，益精。一名牡蒙，一名众戎，一名童肠，一名马行。生河西及宛朐山谷，三月采根，火炙使紫色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162011-jyu2ein","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162011-jyu2ein","updated":"20240611162011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"畏辛荑。 今方家皆呼为牡蒙，用之亦少。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162011-jex44hs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162011-jex44hs","updated":"20240611162011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕紫参，叶似羊蹄，紫花青穗，皮紫黑，肉红白，肉浅皮深。"}]},{"ID":"20240611162011-3uc2m5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611162011-3uc2m5p","updated":"20240611162011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所在有之。牡蒙叶似及己而大，根长尺余，皮肉亦紫色，根苗并不相似。虽一名牡蒙，乃王孙也。紫参京下见用者，是出蒲州也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161839-ns210rp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161839-ns210rp"}},{"ID":"20240611161958-q5o1m6g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161958-q5o1m6g","updated":"20240611162003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161958-84y96vu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161958-84y96vu","updated":"20240611161958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】味苦辛寒。主心腹积聚，寒热邪气。通九窍，利大小便。一名牡蒙。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161958-i07ysec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161958-i07ysec","updated":"20240611161958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微寒，入手太阴肺、手阳明大肠经。消胸中之痞结，止肺家之疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161958-6490obm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161958-6490obm","updated":"20240611161958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"紫参汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"紫参半斤，甘草三两。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治下利肺痛。以肺与大肠，相为表里，肠陷而利作，则肺逆而痛生。而肺肠之失位，原于中气之不运，盖己土不升则庚金陷，戊土不降则辛金逆，甘草补中而培土，紫参清金而破凝，使肺肠之气，各复其升降之旧也。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"泽漆汤"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在泽漆。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之，治咳逆而脉沉者，以其清金而降逆也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161958-4a7lfoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161958-4a7lfoe","updated":"20240611161958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参苦寒，清金泻热。降冲逆而破凝塞，清咳嗽而止疼痛。金清则肺气收摄，故长于敛血，金清则肺气通调，故长于行瘀。其诸主治，止吐衄，消痈肿，利小便，滑大肠，治金疮，调血痢，破瘀血，通闭经，开胸膈积聚，散腹胁坚满。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161839-mh2zzvn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161839-mh2zzvn"}},{"ID":"20240611161850-hv1imbl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161850-hv1imbl","updated":"20240611161858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161850-d1qowkj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161850-d1qowkj","updated":"20240611161850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」牡蒙、童肠、马行、众戎、五鸟花。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161850-hp5jgct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161850-hp5jgct","updated":"20240611161850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（根）苦、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161850-dhel85a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161850-dhel85a","updated":"20240611161850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240611161850-8kpkcpo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161850-8kpkcpo","updated":"20240611161850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、下痢。用紫参半斤，加水五升，煎成二升。再加入甘草二两，煎至半升，分三次服。此方名“紫参汤”。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161850-bq6jid7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161850-bq6jid7","updated":"20240611161850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、吐血不止。用紫参、人参、阿胶（炒），等分为末。每服一钱，乌梅汤送下。又方：与上方基本相同，但减去人参。换为甘草，以糯米汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161850-x3gvmxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161850-x3gvmxv","updated":"20240611161850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、脸上酒刺。用紫参、丹参、人参、苦参、沙参和成一两，共为末，加胡桃仁捣烂，和成丸子，如梧子大。每服三十丸，茶送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161839-ry585kf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161839-ry585kf"}},{"ID":"20240611161840-hc8gw8k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-hc8gw8k","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-sa06sdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-sa06sdh","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-11j7nn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-11j7nn0","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Zǐ Shēn"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-msuiiiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-msuiiiu","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-ttiavil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-ttiavil","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 石见穿、石打穿、月下红"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-f7e798v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-f7e798v","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-gxb4nze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-gxb4nze","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Herba Salviae Chinesnsis"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-tles76a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-tles76a","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-aesx2pw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-aesx2pw","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为唇形科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"华鼠尾"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Salvia chinensis Benth. 的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋季开花时采收，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-8bn2f9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-8bn2f9u","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-aorf8kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-aorf8kb","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生于山坡、路旁、林缘及草丛中。主产江苏、浙江、安徽亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-hex6md7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-hex6md7","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-yfucvd8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-yfucvd8","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 一年生草本，高20～70cm。茎方形，单一或分枝，表面紫棕色或绿色，被倒向柔毛。叶对生，全为单叶或茎下部为三出复叶，卵形或卵状椭圆形，长1.3～7cm，边缘有圆齿。轮伞花序6花，集成假总状或圆锥花序；花萼钟状，紫色；花冠蓝紫色或紫色，外被长柔毛；雄蕊2，花丝短，药隔长；子房4裂，花柱着生子房底。小坚果椭圆状卵形，褐色。花期7～8月，果期9～10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-v9v38rc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-v9v38rc","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-zncr8iz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-zncr8iz","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全草含甾醇、三萜类、氨基酸、原儿茶醛；根含水苏糖（stachyose）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-km6dukm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-km6dukm","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-rlh41p6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-rlh41p6","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性平，味苦、辛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-jpfbodu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-jpfbodu","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-z3tafjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-z3tafjb","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热解毒，活血理气止痛。用于急慢性肝炎、脘胁胀痛、湿热带下、乳腺炎、疔肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-kjb5ips","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-kjb5ips","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611161840-one6wru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161840-one6wru","updated":"20240611161840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161841-z99lxnn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161841-z99lxnn"}},{"ID":"20240611161907-yyercx1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-yyercx1","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：拳参"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-awhhhjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-awhhhjp","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-23wsw1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-23wsw1c","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Quán Shēn"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-35ydyku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-35ydyku","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-3trkb6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-3trkb6p","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 紫参、草河车、刀剪药、铜罗、虾参、地虾、山虾"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-pm7ola6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-pm7ola6","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-l3tfxcq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-l3tfxcq","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" RHIZOMA BISTORTAE"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-h0rr7y2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-h0rr7y2","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-f9jvew0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-f9jvew0","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为蓼科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拳参"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Polygonum bistorta L.的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根茎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。春初发芽时或秋季茎叶将枯萎时采挖，除去泥沙，晒干，去须根。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-upzffrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-upzffrc","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-bwzrynj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-bwzrynj","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品呈扁长条形或扁圆柱形而弯曲，两端略尖，或一端渐细，有的对卷弯曲，长6～13cm,直径1～2.5cm。表面紫褐色或紫黑色，粗糙，一面隆起，一面稍平坦或略具凹槽，全体密具粗环纹，有残留须根或根痕。质硬，断面浅棕红色或棕红色，维管束呈黄白色点状，排列成环。无臭，味苦、涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-xqnilt4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-xqnilt4","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-0qb5hc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-0qb5hc6","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-lea023n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-lea023n","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-ffs5n2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-ffs5n2t","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除去杂质，洗净，略泡，润透，切薄片，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-7agu6ax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-7agu6ax","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-k2g7k3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-k2g7k3i","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）本品粉末淡棕红色。木栓细胞多角形，含棕红色物。草酸钙簇晶甚多，直径15～65μm 。具缘纹孔导管直径20～55μm ，亦有网纹及螺纹导管。纤维长梭形，直径10～20μm ，壁较厚，木化，孔沟明显。淀粉粒椭圆形、卵形或类圆形，直径5～12μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-d5h3ofv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-d5h3ofv","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品1 薄片（或粉末少量），加乙醇2 滴与1％ 三氯化铁乙醇溶液 1滴，显蓝黑色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-wu68irt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-wu68irt","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-l9dkvzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-l9dkvzt","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肺、肝、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-nbpgv11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-nbpgv11","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-8fip20k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-8fip20k","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦、涩，微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-pg5d64n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-pg5d64n","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-csl7uz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-csl7uz6","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热解毒，消肿，止血。用于赤痢，热泻，肺热咳嗽，痈肿，瘰疬，口舌生疮，吐血，衄血，痔疮出血，毒蛇咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-ae026xc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-ae026xc","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-nefebyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-nefebyo","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 4.5～9g。外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-g0jyhi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-g0jyhi5","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-cr10v2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-cr10v2g","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-36cnjur","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-36cnjur","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：拳参"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-3iyzxd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-3iyzxd2","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-35mw4gr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-35mw4gr","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Quán Shēn"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-fa4a4t2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-fa4a4t2","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-di1avpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-di1avpp","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 山虾子（《江苏植药志》），倒根草（《新疆药材》），紫参、破伤药、刀剪药、疙瘩参（《河北药材》），虾参、回头参、山柳柳、石蚕（《山东中药》），刀枪药（《中药志》），马峰七（《广西中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-fp5vs2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-fp5vs2k","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-cbl46di","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-cbl46di","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-0pei0tn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-0pei0tn","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-p0t73ej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-p0t73ej","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为蓼科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拳参"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根茎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。春季未发芽前或秋季茎叶刚枯萎时，采取根茎，去掉残茎及泥土，晒干。搓去须根或烧去须根。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-xv49sfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-xv49sfz","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-guxtzc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-guxtzc7","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生山坡草丛阴湿处。分布华北、西北及河南、湖北、山东、江苏、浙江。产河北、河南、山西、陕西、山东、江苏、湖北、吉林、辽宁等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-kozc7k4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-kozc7k4","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-jwu219m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-jwu219m","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生草本，高50～90厘米。根茎肥厚扭曲，外皮紫红色。茎直立，单一或数茎丛生，不分枝。根生叶丛生，有长柄；叶片椭圆形至卵状披针形，长12～18厘米，宽2.5～6厘米，先端短尖或钝，基部心形或圆形。下延成翅状，边缘外卷，无毛，或有时下面疏被柔毛。茎生叶较小，近乎无柄，叶片披针形至线形；托叶鞘膜质，管状，长达3厘米。穗状花序顶生，长达6厘米；花小，花被白色或淡红色，5裂，裂片长达3毫米；雄蕊8，着生于花被基部；子房上位，花柱3裂。瘦果三棱形，长约3毫米，褐色，常包于宿存花被内。花期夏、秋季。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-iqg1nlz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-iqg1nlz","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-fwm26ur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-fwm26ur","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥根茎呈扁圆柱形而弯曲，两端圆钝或稍尖，长3～10厘米，径约1～2厘米，外表紫褐色，有细密环节，顶端有芽或残茎痕，两侧残留细硬须根或白色根痕。质硬脆，易折断，断面棕红色或赤褐色，近边缘有一圈维管束排成的白色小点。气无，味苦涩。以粗大、坚硬、断面红棕色、无须根者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-n13fg6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-n13fg6e","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-ey3w3jx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-ey3w3jx","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拳参根茎含鞣质8.7～25.0％，淀粉12～45.81％，糖类5.7～7.5％，及果胶、树胶、粘液质、树脂等。鞣质中，有可水解鞣质和缩合鞣质，尚有没食子酸、并没食子酸、D-儿茶酚、L-表儿茶酚、6-没食子酰葡萄糖和3，6-二没食子酰葡萄糖。另含葡萄糖和β-谷甾醇的异构体。叶含鞣质5～10％，茎中则仅为痕量。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-e8jg890","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-e8jg890","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-xkqq35s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-xkqq35s","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拳参渗漉液与明胶等制成的\"止血净\"1号，用于犬和绵羊各种止血实验（股动脉切断，肝脏剪口，脾脏切除等出血）均有一定止血效果。在体外对金黄色葡萄球菌、绿脓杆菌、枯草杆菌、大肠杆菌等均有抗菌作用（平板打洞法）。拳参毒性很小，用其提取液（100％）小鼠腹腔注射的半数致死量为0.33克/鼠；兔用\"止血净\"腹腔注射（0.2克/公斤），观察5天，于30天后解剖，未发现异常。\"止血净\"1号组织埋藏，可以吸收，初步证明有一定止血消炎作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-apru9ls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-apru9ls","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-tuh983s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-tuh983s","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-ysvplfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-ysvplfp","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《现代实用中药》：\"酸苦，有小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-qx28hr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-qx28hr9","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《中药志》：\"苦，微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-6657k1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-6657k1k","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-uhh7tlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-uhh7tlm","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 无实火热毒者不宜。阴证外疡忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-7p8mnlt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-7p8mnlt","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-b6sl1xv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-b6sl1xv","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热镇惊，理湿消肿。治热病惊搐，破伤风，赤痢，痈肿，瘰疬。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-j1vvyu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-j1vvyu5","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草图经》：\"捣末，淋渫肿气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-e13ik86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-e13ik86","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《现代实用中药》：\"内服治赤痢；含漱作口腔炎之收敛剂；外用治痔疮及肿疡。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-v0s0t4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-v0s0t4p","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《中药志》：\"清热解毒，散结消肿。治热病惊痫，手足抽搐，破伤风，痈肿瘰疬，蛇虫咬伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-8v5y2zj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-8v5y2zj","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《广西中药志》：\"治肠胃湿热，赤痢，外用治口糜，痈肿，火伤。民间作产后补血药。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-7hqbioy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-7hqbioy","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-vx4trjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-vx4trjd","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1～3钱；或研末作丸、散。外用：捣敷、煎水含漱或洗涤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-b80930y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-b80930y","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-3utc0h3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-3utc0h3","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疗菌痢、肠炎"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-t6ryg1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-t6ryg1y","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用拳参制成片剂，每片含药0.3克。每次4片，日服3次。治疗菌痢80例，平均服药6.6天，结果治愈71例，好转5例，无效4例。有效病例平均1天退热，其他症状体征的平均消失时间为：腹痛3.8天，里急后重2.7天，脓血便2.9天，便次复常3.3天。也有用拳参1两，水煎服，每天1～2次，治疗菌痢、肠炎共130例，均有一定效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-e1wofra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-e1wofra","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗肺结核"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-3cta4cv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-3cta4cv","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取拳参洗净晒干粉碎，加淀粉调匀压成0.3克的片剂。成人每次4～6片，小儿酌减。治疗12例，服药时间最长者半年，最短者40天。结果3例原发综合征均痊愈；9例浸润型肺结核痊愈5例，好转3例，1例无效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-gzn8fuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-gzn8fuq","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疗慢性气管炎"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-x099i9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-x099i9l","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用1：1紫参（石生蓼的根茎）注射液（每毫升含紫参黄酮2.2～2.5毫克）肌肉注射，场次2毫升，每日2次，10天为一疗程。治疗103例，年龄50～80岁，病程2～45年。除1例合并严重肺心病无效外，其余102例均有效。病型与疗效无明显关系。三个疗程后症状和体征的消失率分别为：咳嗽72.8％，咳痰79.9％，气喘77.1％，干湿性罗音67.2％。咳嗽、咳痰、气喘与罗音的见效时间多数在4～10天内。但消炎作用较差。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-gbc5usi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-gbc5usi","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-c4tuw0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-c4tuw0g","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除上述品种外，蓼属拳参组的多种植物，如石生蓼（分布东北）、珠芽蓼（详\"蝎子七\"条）、耳叶蓼（分布东北）、毛耳叶寥（分布东北）、狐尾蓼（分布东北）、太平洋蓼（分布东北）、圆穗蓼（详\"蝎子七\"条）等，亦均同等入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-khv0ckr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-khv0ckr","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品在药材商品中，习称\"草河车\"或\"重楼\"，但\"草河车\"、\"重楼\"又为蚤休的异名，参见\"蚤休\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-5t5x66p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-5t5x66p","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-fw9i8ib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-fw9i8ib","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-dwevrot","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-dwevrot","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：拳参"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-yp07j8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-yp07j8w","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-vayuzdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-vayuzdn","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Quán Shēn"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-dm7a8p8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-dm7a8p8","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-1oays05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-1oays05","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 紫参、牡蒙、众戎、音腹、伏菟、重伤、童肠、马行、刀剪药、刀枪药、疙瘩参、破伤药、铜罗、虾参、山虾、山虾子、地虾、拳头参、回头参、红苍术、红重楼、红蚤体、活血莲、红内消、马尾七、土马蜂、涩疙瘩、一口血、鸢头鸡、地蜂子、红三七、红地榆、地蚕子"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-toh3gho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-toh3gho","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-ppwudhf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-ppwudhf","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草图经》：拳参，生淄州田野。叶如羊蹄，根似海虾，黑色。五月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-ft8a5e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-ft8a5e3","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《唐本草》中所载紫参及《本草图经》的晋州紫参，为蓉属拳参组植物。故本品亦即本草紫参中的一种。参见紫参条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-z5y90wn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-z5y90wn","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-leiz113","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-leiz113","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为蓼科植物拳参或耳叶蓼的根茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-e7xxfy9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-e7xxfy9","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：l．拳参Polygonum bistorta L．[P．Lapidosum Kitag．」2． Petr．Ex Kom．"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-9ljrrwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-9ljrrwe","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：春、秋两季挖取根状茎，去掉茎、叶净，晒干或切片晒干，亦可鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-ry06s1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-ry06s1o","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-8dostaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-8dostaw","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.生于山野草丛中或林下阴湿处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-ebkcz4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-ebkcz4e","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生于山坡或草丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-lzizg7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-lzizg7y","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于辽宁、内蒙古、河北、山西、陕西、宁夏、甘肃、新疆、山东、江苏、安徽、浙江、河南、湖北、湖南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-cgogz05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-cgogz05","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于东北各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-vqth4uk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-vqth4uk","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-b8z49gf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-b8z49gf","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.多年生草本，高35-90cm。根茎肥厚，弯曲，外皮紫棕色。茎直立，单一，无毛。基生叶有长柄；叶片革质，长圆披针形或披针形，长10-20cm，宽2-6cm，先端长渐尖，基部圆钝或截形有时心形，沿叶柄下延成翅状，边缘外卷，两面稍被毛，老时渐脱落，下面具网脉；茎生叶互生，向上柄渐短至抱茎，托叶鞘筒状，膜质，长2-5cm。总状花序呈穗状顶生，圆柱形，直立或稍弯，长3-6cm；小花密集，苞片卵形，膜质，花梗纤细；花淡红色或白色，直径约2.5mm，花被5深裂，裂片椭圆形；雄蕊8，与花被近等长或稍长；花往3。瘦果三棱状椭圆形，红棕色，光亮，包于宿存花被内。花期6-9月，果期9-11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-lkzmkwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-lkzmkwn","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.与拳参相似，其主要区别在于：本种的叶呈披针形或卵状长圆形.长5-9cm，宽O.7-2.4cm，基部图形。边缘具有较明显凸起的脉端，叶片两面无毛。茎有8-9个节。瘦果的棕黑色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-bsg4xl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-bsg4xl2","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-gy8z6g4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-gy8z6g4","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学特性 喜凉爽气候，耐寒又耐旱。宜选向阳排水良好的砂质壤上或石灰质壤土栽种。栽培技术 种子繁殖：北方4月上旬条播，行距30～45cm，开浅沟，将种子均匀撒入沟内覆土0．3～1cm，每1hm2播种量1．5～2．25kg。当苗高3～6cm时，按株距15-30cm间苗，也可用育苗移栽法。分根繁殖：秋季或春季萌芽前，挖出根状茎，每株可分成2～3株，按行距30～45cm，株距30cm栽种，覆土，压实。春栽2～3星期萌芽生长。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-nmn5btl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-nmn5btl","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-l5xyv6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-l5xyv6r","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 根茎扁圆柱形，弯曲成虾状，长4-15cm,直径l-2．5cm。表面紫褐色或紫黑色，稍粗糙，有较密环节及残留须根或根痕，一面隆起，另面较平坦或略具凹槽。质硬，断面近肾形，浅棕红色，黄白色维管束细点排成断续环状。气微，味苦、涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-ddtbbnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-ddtbbnf","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以粗大、坚硬、断面浅红棕色者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-k6hutef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-k6hutef","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 根茎横切面：木柱层为数列木柱细胞，深棕色。皮层较宽。维管束外韧型，断续排列成环，有的韧皮部外侧有纤维束。髓部大。薄壁细胞中含较多草酸钙簇晶及淀粉粒。理化鉴别 取本品粉末约0．5g，加水4ml，微热，滤过。取滤液1ml，加三氯化铁试液1滴，产生蓝黑色沉淀，稍振摇，滤液即显茶蓝色。或取本品一薄片（或粉末少量）加乙醇2滴与1%三氯化铁的乙醇溶液1滴，显蓝黑色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-dtrbnby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-dtrbnby","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-bft2h5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-bft2h5j","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拳参根茎含没食子酸（gallic acid），并没食子酸（ellagic acid）以及可水解鞣质和缩合鞣质。还含右旋儿茶酚（catechol），左旋表茶酚（epicatechol），6-没食子酰葡萄糖galloylglucose），3，6-二没食子酸葡萄糖（3，6－digalloyl glucose葡萄糖（glucose)[1]。又含羟基甲基蒽醌、维生素[2]、β-谷甾醇的异构体等[1]。全草含绿原酸（chloroenic acid），咖啡酸（caffeicacid），原儿茶酸（protocatechuic acid）及金丝桃甙（hyperin)等[3，4]。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-mq7k0fk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-mq7k0fk","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-z74f4rq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-z74f4rq","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拳参渗漉液与明胶等制成的止血净1号， 用于犬和绵羊各种止血实验(股动脉切断，肝脏剪口，脾脏切除等出血)均有一定止血效果。在体外对金黄色葡萄球菌、绿脓杆菌、枯草杆菌、大肠杆菌等均有抗菌作用(平板打洞按)。拳参毒性很小，用其提取液(100露)小鼠腹腔注射的半数致死量为0.33g/鼠；兔用止血净腹腔注射(0.2g/kg)，观察5天，于30天后解剖，未发现异常。止血净 l号组织埋藏，可以吸收。初步证明有一定止血消炎作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-ly6x4vl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-ly6x4vl","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拳参渗漉液与明胶等制成的止血净1号，用于犬和绵羊各种止血实验均有一定止血效果。在体外对金黄色葡萄球菌、绿脓杆菌、枯草杆菌、大肠杆菌等均有抗菌作用。用本品提取液(100%)注入小鼠腹腔注射的半数致死量为0.33g/kg；用止血净注入兔腹腔(0.2g/kg)观察5天，于30天后解剖，未发现异常，止血净1号组织埋藏可以吸收。初步证明有一定止血消炎作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-q6nf6fw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-q6nf6fw","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-cxcqy5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-cxcqy5p","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取本品粉末约0.5g，加水4ml，微热，滤过，取滤液1ml，加三氯化铁试剂1滴，产生蓝黑色沉淀，稍一振摇，滤液即显茶蓝色。(检查鞣质)"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-1aayhm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-1aayhm3","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-vxewm64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-vxewm64","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦；性微寒；小毒"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-lkm0nfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-lkm0nfm","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-gl7aq2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-gl7aq2a","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 无实火热毒者不宜。阴证外疡忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-w6p237t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-w6p237t","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-6565bbw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-6565bbw","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热利湿；凉血止血；解毒散结。主肺热咳嗽；热病惊痫；赤痢；热泻；吐血；衄血；痔疮出血；痈肿疮毒"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-y0fj5uj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-y0fj5uj","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-nenvvqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-nenvvqe","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-12g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，捣敷或煎水含漱、熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-3hznlnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-3hznlnk","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-fzwvpjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-fzwvpjh","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.治疗菌痢、肠炎：用拳参制成片剂，每片含药0.3g。每次4片，日服3次。治疗菌痢80例，平均服药6.6天，结果治愈71例，好转5例，无效吐例。有效病例平均 l天退热，其他症状体征的平均消失时间为：腹痛3.8天，里急后重2.7天，脓血便2.9天，便次复常3.3天。也有用拳参1两，水煎服，每天1-2次，治疗菌痢、肠炎共130例，均有一定效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-6txhk91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-6txhk91","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.治疗肺结核：取拳参洗净晒干粉碎，加淀粉调匀压成0.3g的片剂。成人每次4-6片，小儿酌减。治疗12例，服药时间最长者半年，最短者40天。结果3例原发综合征均痊愈；9例浸润型肺结核痊愈5例，好转3例，1例无效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-6bcpdm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-6bcpdm5","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.治疗慢性气管炎：用1：1紫参(石生蓼的根茎)注射液(每ml含紫参黄酮2.2-2.5mg)肌肉注射，每次2ml，每日2次，10天为一疗程。治疗103例，年龄；0-30岁，病程2-45年。除 l例合并严重肺心病无效外，其余102例均有效。病型与疗效无明显关系。三个疗程后症状和体征的消失率分别为：咳嗽72.8%，咳痰79月%，气喘77.1%，干湿性罗音67.2%。咳嗽、咳痰、气喘与罗音的见效时间多数在凄-10天内。但消炎作用较差。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-06qe5lo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-06qe5lo","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611161907-maa6lzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161907-maa6lzy","updated":"20240611161907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161908-oyl2x1y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161908-oyl2x1y"}},{"ID":"20240611161909-wcp2g97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161909-wcp2g97"}}]}